<title>POLAND: Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourteen stocks closed higher and seven were flat in 8.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat in a 13.9-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
